Lineage: this codebase originates from an earlier internal prototype as a
company-operated confidential-address-vault product. That approach was
abandoned — a company-operated address vault does not survive sovereignty,
adoption-physics, or governance review — in favor of donating a generic,
purpose-agnostic capability-grant primitive (this repository) as a protocol
contribution instead. Product-specific naming was removed from the code and
history because it named a discontinued product, not to obscure the project's
origin; this NOTICE exists so that distinction is never left to inference.
